        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live a sweet and endearing story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116190/extras/c85cc7590bb6d00a4fc540da83f1f215.avif?t=1764887479\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the eyes, mind, and heart of Haruto, a teenager about to discover love in a small town where everyone knows each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116190/extras/a1892ad573e82f61705682cd1880777a.avif?t=1764887479\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make decisions and discover the different stories that await you in this novel full of possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116190/extras/97569301a10601a15c5d5a5745b239a6.avif?t=1764887479\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give a chance to those who live on the fringe... and you might discover that they also have a good heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116190/extras/b421b9ab0196a051b9b1356a653f9397.avif?t=1764887479\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Really: create your own story. Play it over and over again, explore new paths, and meet the endearing characters who inhabit this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116190/extras/b5481d7dfcde4c6fe168620672a10126.avif?t=1764887479\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
